\docType{package}
\title{Banking Delta Lakehouse R Analysis Layer}
\description{
Read-only analysis of the PostgreSQL \code{marts} schema. Functions cover gating,
contracts, extraction, descriptive analytics, forecasting, and predictive scoring.
}
\details{
The package is run from \code{r/main.R} and writes outputs below
\code{output/runs/<run_key>}. It never writes to the warehouse.
}
